<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Villain</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">JOEY DJIA, Omar Kadir</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Wish I Never (Acoustics)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2uwPdSO187PiHz1cQSGGoC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">1 Contributor</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wildfire Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Somebody at the top</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The man behind the curtain</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tried to put a stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[BOTH]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Try to change the race for certain</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Well, I can smell the smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And I can feel the heat</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is this a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Or just a joke?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Grab your popcorn</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Take a seat[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Drop the bomb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Time to intervene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Light the match</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pour more gasoline</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hang them out to dry</p><p ttm:agent="v1">While we make a scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[BOTH]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The flames are rising higher</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MR. WARREN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(spoken) I thought I sent you home</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And viewers, Autumn was suspended</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MR. WARREN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Turn that thing off!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're live!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MR. WARREN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The hell we are![AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say hello to all of Riverside, Principal Warren</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(singing) Suddenly on display</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Bring on the insurrection</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Didn't have to end this way</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE AND AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But it was a rigged election</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">See Autumn won the race</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But someone changed the score</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This truth is in our face</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Won't be silent anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Zoom in, Cory[ENSEMBLE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, they dropped the bomb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And it's quite a scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lit the match</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Poured the gasoline</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's full on display</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You know what I mean</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE AND AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The flames are rising higher</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[ENSEMBLE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(spoken) Ms. James?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ms. President?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You must be so excited</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Who rigged the election?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I... I oversee the election results</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So you did it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I didn't say that</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You didn't deny it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Stevie, these are the actual results</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[ENSEMBLE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(singing) Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(spoken) Where did you get this?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Something's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But something's right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wasn't in the cards to lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Not today, Satan!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[BOTH]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But something's right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And something's wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now there's someone to accuse</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(spoken) Is that thing on?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You took this opportunity away from me, and now I'm suspended</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I have the jurisdiction to monitor the voting process</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Manipulate</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I didn't want to!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Then why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Turn the camera off</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">No!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Keep rolling!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You don't want this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We've got nothing else to hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(singing) Fine, I'll drop the bomb</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What's there to lose?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You want the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Well, it's yours to choose</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(spoken) A student was going to out you, Autumn. And Stevie</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You knew?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[JESSE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">That's why you didn't want to be with me!</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[AUTUMN]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's all over...</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm out of here</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[MS. JAMES]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(singing) Now it's on the air</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Autumn]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's the evening news</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[STEVIE?]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Right down to the wire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[BOTH]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[ENSEMBLE]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like wildfire)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Spreading</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wildfire</p></div></body></tt>